window.products.push({"id":674015,"name":"UPTARD Wood Carved Analog Battery Operated 12 inch Wall Clock –Silent Wooden Quartz Wall Clock for Living Room Decor –Sweep Movement Rustic Decorative","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51f8xmmkbeL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"★ PREMIUM QUALITY ★ UPTARD wall clock is made of high quality, safe, environmentally-friendly, non-toxic and MDF wood material. Our analog wall clock is not only portable with its perfect lightweight but also perfectly durable for long-time usage. Thanks to its unique design, our silent wall clock for the living room is easy to clean and easy to hang. ★ UNIQUE HOME DECOR ★ UPTARD battery operated 12inch wall clock is a great home, office, kitchen decor option for your sweet living places. With the handmade and modern wood carved number design, it will be an elegant wall decor that will create various color match wall decorations depend on your wall background. You will have a modern rustic style atmosphere in your kitchen, dining hall, living room, office with our unique design round quartz wall clock. ★ PERFECTLY SILENT MECHANISM ★ UPTARD silent wall clock for living room decor has a perfectly silent mechanism thanks to its non ticking feature. Our sweep movement decorative wall clock will provide an absolutely quiet environment in your bedroom, meeting room, kitchen while showing the time accurately. You don’t need to worry about ticking noise. It will ensure you a perfectly quiet sleeping or working place during your day. ★ EASY TO READ ★ With the wooden carved large numbers, our kitchen wall clock has a clear view to read the time easily. Thanks to its carved design, numbers will be in different colors depending on background and you will easily read them. Our decorative quartz wall clock will tell you the time with a modern and easy to read appearance. ★ SATISFACTION GUARANTEE ★ UPTARD battery operated sweep movement decorative wall clock is a great gift option for your family and friends as birthday, anniversary, mothers day, holiday gift and more. The package includes 1 x clock and 1 x cement nail. It is easy to use. You will just need to insert 1 AA carbon battery ( Not Included ) before hanging it. For any question about our product, feel free to contact us and we will solve it in 24h. Let’s keep the time in a modern way !","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51f8xmmkbeL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"UPTARD","source_asin":"B09C8LQFN6","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-674015","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09C8LQFN6","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09C8LQFN6","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":674016,"name":"KX-WARE 18-ounce Acrylic Stemless Wine Glasses, Set of 4 Multicolor","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":15.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/515iXBcDYCL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Classic Colorful 18-ounce Acrylic Wine Glasses Enjoy your favorite beverage in these crystal-clear drinking cups. Perfect for everyday use at family dinners and entertaining at a home bar. Serve guests soda, lemonade, or iced-tea with these durable cups while dining outdoors on the patio or poolside. The superior clarity, thick base, and straight walls compose the hammered design of the Classic Water Tumblers. They fit into any style or theme.BPA-free and Top Rack Dishwasher Safe We are committed to using only the best BPA-free, food safe materials to create products you can feel good about using every day. Consumer safety and peace of mind is our top priority. Our products are made from durable materials that will not shatter like glass. Place on the top rack or hand-wash to maintain the clarity of products. Enjoy stylish designs and colors that will last.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/515iXBcDYCL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"KX-WARE","source_asin":"B092VV3BCY","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-674016","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B092VV3BCY","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B092VV3BCY","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":674017,"name":"Made in Mexico Mejicana Churrera Churro Maker Churros Manual Hand Machine Metal/Wood w/2 molds","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":49.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/5177fHgL+pL._AC_.jpg","description":"The origin of Chorros is actually from China which made a pastry called the “oil-fried devil.” The Portuguese brought this savory snack to the Iberian Peninsula after their journeys. The Spanish lost interest in the Chinese history and simply named it after the churra sheep and their horns which have a similar shape. All that history behind it the Churros were perfected by Mexicans and brought into United States many years ago. No one knows Churros like Mexicans do. They also have perfected machines that make them and this machine is developed by Mexicans and imported into United States from Mexico. There is no other machine as authentic Mexican as this one. We are proud to be the one to list it on Amazon.com and show the world this beautifully designed machine. This is how you work with it. Put one of the molds into the metal Cylinder followed by the dough and then put the wooden part into the chamber. Hold against your body, Hold the metal handles with your hands and pull towards you. Very simple and easy to work with. Once you are done just wash with soapy water and rinse. That's it. It's that easy.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/5177fHgL+pL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"always-quality","source_asin":"B07CX8W2T2","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-674017","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07CX8W2T2","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07CX8W2T2","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
