window.products.push({"id":674060,"name":"Ambesonne Mystic Shower Curtain, Animal with Burning Eyes in The Dark Forest at Night Horror Halloween Illustration, Cloth Fabric Bathroom Decor Set w","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71rS3QoSBRL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Your purchase will help victims of recent major earthquakes in Turkey since we donate a percentage of our profits to local NGOs helping with quake relief efforts. Measurements - 69” wide x 70” long. No liner needed. 12 hooks included. Made in Turkey. Made from - High quality %100 polyester Turkish fabric material. Water resistant. Non-vinyl. Non-PEVA. Easy to use - Machine washable and dries fast. Features vibrant colors and clear image. No fading. Adds great perspective - Bold graphics printed with state of the art digital printing technology. Designer artwork - Not a common usual shower curtain you can find anywhere. Unique. Genuine. Fun.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71rS3QoSBRL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Ambesonne","source_asin":"B01JIWVRPM","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-674060","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01JIWVRPM","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01JIWVRPM","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":674061,"name":"Swig Savvy BPA-Free Leak-Proof Stainless Steel Wide Mouth Insulated Water Bottle with Interchangeable Caps, 2 Pack, Red","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71WuQYsSvLL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Anyone who is constantly on-the-go would appreciate a durable drinking container. Imagine being able to quench your thirst under the sweltering sun with a nice chilled drink or to be able to treat yourself to a sip of a warm beverage in the middle of a frosty weather. Luckily, the Swig Savvy Stainless Steel Water Bottle with Vacuum Insulated Double Wall is a versatile water flask, suitable for carrying both cold and hot liquids . The Swig Savvy Stainless Steel Water Bottle promises incredible temperature retention properties. Slip in a few pieces of ice cubes on your drink and enjoy long-lasting cold drinks for as long as 24 hours . Enjoy smoothies, juice, iced-coffee, shakes, lemonade, ice tea and more without compromising it's natural taste and temperature. Get yourself a comforting hot cocoa, coffee, tea, chocolate milk and other hot beverages for up to 12 hours . This travel-friendly reusable drinking thermos is a great companion for people with an active lifestyle. The Swig Savvy Stainless Steel Water Bottle offers convenient features such as an interchangeable leak proof caps . The first lid is designed with a Click Cap Cover , a feature that offers spill proof and airtight hydration solution. Making it ideal for students, office workers, and kids. The second lid, is a unique Twist Open Sports Cap that allows you to easily guzzle down a drink while your hiking, working out, camping, biking or running. It features a leak-resistant lid that effectively opens with a single twist for a quick drink. Get your own Swig Savvy Stainless Steel Water Bottle with Vacuum Insulated Double Wall Design , for a reliable travel companion that won't sacrifice a good beverage while on the go!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71WuQYsSvLL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Swig Savvy","source_asin":"B01HFHAUAU","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-674061","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01HFHAUAU","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01HFHAUAU","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
