window.products.push({"id":674164,"name":"Portable Air Conditioner, 90° Oscillating Portable AC, Battery powered cordless Personal Air Cooler, Quick Cool, Suitable for Tent, Camping, Bedside, ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71mTSxd9m3L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Multifunction Use】2022 Upgraded Personal Air Conditioner is suitable for all year using. It's not only a fan & AC unit but also an air humidifer that helps cooling down in hot seasons and humidifying in dry seasons. This upgraded cooler owns a powerful and quiet motor. When it's working, the noise is quieter than in the library. Plus with the Auto 90° L-R Oscilation function, this good companion brings you every comfortable and quality sleep, avoids blowing the wind just in one direction. 【Large Capacity Battery & Portable Design】With the upgraded built-in 4000mAh rechargeable battery, the air cooler can work continuously for 3-5 hours when fully charged(It depends on the wind speed level). It supports USB charging like via a power bank. The cordless & hand strap design makes it free to go. When traveling and camping, this lightweight & portable air cooler is your best choice. 【Large Capacity Water Tank】The upgraded 350ML Large Water Tank lengthen its humidify time, it can be used for 3-4 hours when fill it up. The mist spray keeps your skin cool and moisture and stay away from the dryness. The thoughtful place on the top desgin increase the convenience of water injection and avoid water leakage. When the water in the water tank is used up, the spray function will be automatically turned off. 【3 Wind Speeds & 7 Colors Light】Three wind speeds(high/medium/low) can be adjusted,manual up-down the blowing direction to meet your different needs. When the hot air go through the ice curtain soaked in ice water, it will be cooled 3-10℃ down. Only in 3s, the mini air cooler blows out the cool wind to you, what keeps your personal space at around 25℃ for about 6 hours. The built-in 7 Colors LED ligt with Color-Cycle Option. You can set automatic color cycle or fix the color you like. 【Eco-friendly & Energy Saving】It does not contain harmful refrigerant, nor does it use a compressor like a conventional power consuming air conditioner. With high efficiency at low power of working wattage: 1W-9.2W, it saves your electricity bills and does no harm to the environment. If there's any using problem, please contact us freely, we'll reply you within 12hours. Our support center will arrange replacement for you at the soonest. We'll always at your service.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71mTSxd9m3L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ENKLEN","source_asin":"B09SHSZZ19","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-674164","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09SHSZZ19","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09SHSZZ19","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":674165,"name":"Digging Dolls: 1 Piece of a Mosasaur Tooth on Rock from Morocco - Natural Polished Fossils!","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":14.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/710cQbUw2HL._AC_SL1152_.jpg","description":"The Digging Dolls Brand of stones is owned by female rock hounds who care deeply about providing only the best quality and most spectacular stones on the market. When you order any authentic Digging Dolls product you can be certain that every order has been through a rigorous quality control process and only the best products are allowed to feature our Digging Dolls logo.These specimens of a Mosasaur Tooth on rock are actual fossils that have been polished within the matrix to bring out their spectacular beauty. A mosasaur was a carnivorous marine lizard from the Cretaceous Period. Their teeth were most likely used to open sea urchins and mollusks. Our Dolls meet with the mine owners from Moroccco multiple times per year and scrutinize every shipment of Fossils to ensure they meet the high standards required to be part of the Digging Dolls brand. These fossils are can be used for many different purposes including home decor, wedding decor, crafts, art projects, reiki, office decor, specimens, collecting, gift giving and so much more!Every fossil is unique and you will not be receiving the exact ones in the pictures. As earth mined specimen pieces it is possible the stones may include possible minor flaws, imperfections, variance in colors, shapes, sizes, and patterns in every fossil.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/710cQbUw2HL._AC_SL1152_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Digging Dolls","source_asin":"B07NYRRPKZ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-674165","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07NYRRPKZ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07NYRRPKZ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
