window.products.push({"id":674253,"name":"Nika's Home Apple Pie Soy Candle 12oz Mason Jar Non-Toxic White Soy Handmade, Long Burning 50-60 Hours Highly Scented All Natural, Clean Burning Large","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":16.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71P5GnXZt1L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"100% SOY WAX NON-TOXIC CANDLES: We at Nika’s Candle care about the environment and that of your home. We carefully researched the best way to make our candles non-toxic and eco-friendly. Our vegan soy candles are 100% vegan soy wax with a single cotton wick made of natural fibers. Our scented candles are made of plain white soy wax in order to avoid using chemical-based dyes so our candles are better for your home environment. HAND POURED IN THE USA: We started as a hobby in a 600 sq. foot apartment and turned into a small business in 2014 with the encouragement of friends and family. Each soy mason jar candle is wicked, hand-poured, and labeled with love. We make daily small batches of our glass mason jar candles in a small shop in Massachusetts to ensure that every candle is perfect. LONG BURNING CANDLES: Nika’s warm apple pie soy candles are single-wick, non-toxic soy candle burns clean and evenly and all the way to the edges, reducing wasted wax. Each of our Nika’s Home long lasting candles has a burn time that lasts between 50-60 hours, so you can enjoy our white candles long-term. To maximize burn time it is best to trim your wick to before candle is lit each time. HIGHLY SCENTED: We also use high-quality fragrance essential oils to ensure strong scented relaxing aromatherapy candles. Our goal is to provide you with a premium scented apple pie candle. Bring home candles the warm, welcoming scent of Baba's kitchen. With top notes of freshly picked apples and spicy cinnamon and the subtle, sweet smell of brown sugar. NIKA’S HOME SOY CANDLES 100% GUARANTEE: If you are not satisfied for any reason with our Nika’s candles organic soy candles, just let us know and we will refund your purchase! We know it's hard to buy candles online and want to ensure your purchase is worry-free.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71P5GnXZt1L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Nika's Home","source_asin":"B0749NK7C9","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-674253","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0749NK7C9","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0749NK7C9","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":674254,"name":"OYRING Valances for Windows Light Grey Window Valance for Living Room Rod Pocket Blackout Valance for Bedroom，Pack of 2 （Light Grey 39\" W x 20\" L）","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":37.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/712Uefa6uTL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Material：Pure polyester,blackout fabric is heavy and soft which is very up market. Easy to install ：A convenient rod pocket header effortlessly slides over your preferred curtain rod (not included), Quick and easy installation. Extensive Use: These valances for windows can compliment with any other solid drapes. Suitable for kitchen, living room, bedroom, basement, Infant room and more. Adding elegance to home decor while providing multiple functions Light Blocking valances: These valances block some unwanted light and also provide thermal insulation and certain privacy protection. Easy Cleaning Instructions: Our valances are machine washable in cold water, tumble dry on low or natural dry, iron at low temperature.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/712Uefa6uTL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"OYRING","source_asin":"B0B5D2WKRL","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-674254","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B5D2WKRL","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B5D2WKRL","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":674255,"name":"2'x3' Hearth Rug Fireplace Lodge Cabin Bear Wild Life 26\"x 38\" Fire Retardant","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/A191PWokLDL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Beautiful Hearthrug for Fireplace or anywhere around inside the house. It's low pile surface is made with fire retardant olefin/ polypropylene, it measures approximately 26\" x 38\". It is very easy to clean and maintain. Rug pad use is recommended on smooth surfaces. WARNING: Never allow rug to come in direct contact with open flame or heat source","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/A191PWokLDL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"DESIGNER RUGS","source_asin":"B00VEM6CUA","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-674255","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00VEM6CUA","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00VEM6CUA","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":674256,"name":"OmniShield Professional Full Sound Enclosure, Compatible with JTC OmniBlend and Vitamix","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/616rHjLv2sL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"OmniShield Soft Sound Technology The OmniShield sound enclosure, with our Soft Sound technology, is the most efficient noise reduction sound shield for a commercial blender and is constructed of the same material used in aircraft windshields and fighter jet canopies. While most sound enclosures are simply a lid that is placed on top of a blender base and will cover just the container area, the OmniShield fully encases the entire blender to minimize any noise leakage that originates from a blender’s motor base. This upgrade in sound isolation can be important when you don’t want to disturb customers or simply a quieter kitchen. The Perfect Companion For Your OmniBlend & Vitamix Any OmniBlend blender with a 1.5 liter container can be dropped into the OmniShield sound enclosure. Will upgrade your industrial strength OmniBlend with significantly reduced volume levels. NOTE: 2.0 liter container not compatible with the OmniShield  If you have a Classic series Vitamix blender equipped with a low profile container (64 oz/32 oz), it will be compatible with the OmniShield (for example: E310, 5300, etc.) Please contact our manufacturer to confirm if your set up will fit! NOTE: Vitamix Ascent series (A2300, A2500, A3300, A3500) will NOT be compatible with the OmniShield","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/616rHjLv2sL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"JTC OmniBlend","source_asin":"B07PT47N1K","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-674256","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07PT47N1K","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07PT47N1K","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
