window.products.push({"id":674314,"name":"cosimates Lift Top Coffee Table ，4 in 1 Multi-Function Coffee Table with Hidden Compartment ，Modern Lift Tabletop Dining Table for Living Room Recepti","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":199.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/910HYlq0SJL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Multi-Function】Very practical 3-in-1 lift top coffee table with magazine rack and extendible console. There are three different forms of the coffee table, you can switch at will to meet your daily needs. You can use it as a TV cabinet or a coffee table in the living room. When half unfolded, it can be used as a computer desk without interfering with each other, and when fully unfolded, it can become a dining table for 4-8 people. 【Pneumatic lifting mechanism】The lift top coffee table can be effortlessly lifted up and forward.Compared with the spring-lift mechanism, the pneumatic lift mechanism allows for a smoother operation and quieter tabletop landing, which is more user-friendly and without noise， And can provide a maximum load of 200lbs. 【Adjustable protective feet】The lift top coffee table is equipped with 4 plastic feet to provide balance and stability, with rubber pads on the feet to protect your floor from any damage.In case of uneven floors, these screw-in feet help level the table to the floor. 【Style】The simple design make this modern extendible table with lift-top the perfect addition to your living or dining room. It can be a practical accent coffee table in the living room, office, reception room or limited space. 【Easy & Fast Setup and Clean】 Follow the enclosed parts, tools and illustrated assembly instructions.assembly complete effortlessly. The water-resistant surface makes cleaning a breeze,you just need a damp cloth. 【Fits Small Spaces】 The table top measures: 39.4”W x 19.7”D, when fully unfolded you get double the space and the dimensions become: 39.4”W x 39.4”D. This coffee table is definitely a bonus for small spaces, and Make your room more spatial. 【18 Months Warranty】If your item arrives damaged, scratched or missing part, please feel free to contact us, we will send you free replacement or offer a partial refund.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/910HYlq0SJL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"cosimates","source_asin":"B0BR3QXZQ6","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-674314","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BR3QXZQ6","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BR3QXZQ6","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
