window.products.push({"id":674388,"name":"Gold Ornate Frameen Coffee Co Artwork by Ryan Fowler, 11 by 11-Inch, Matte Black","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":43.82,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81R1OheQWVL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"This ready to hang, matted framed art piece features a golden retriever balancing a coffee mug on its nose. Ryan fowler is an illustrator and graphic artist based in Chicago and Middlebury, Vermont. Ryan received his MFA from Rhode island school of design where he studied photography. His artistic process was informed by his study of photography and photographic printing methods, both in the darkroom and on the computer. Ryan uses a hybrid of traditional and modern techniques utilizing drawings, paintings and computer-based illustration tools. Ryan covers a variety of subject matter with his work including animals, landscapes, children's art, typography and graphic design. His work is inspired by nature, advertising design and new England and pacific northwest iconography. A 7x7 giclee print under acrylic in an 11x11 black frame. Giclee (jee-clay) is an advanced printmaking process for creating museum quality fine art reproductions. This high quality print is matted using black matting and comes in a black frame. A clear acrylic facing is added to protect the print. The piece is fully assembled by professional framers and comes ready to hang. The black mat allows the image to really stand out, making it a great addition to any space.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81R1OheQWVL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Trademark Fine Art","source_asin":"B00OA3JXQK","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-674388","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00OA3JXQK","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00OA3JXQK","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
