window.products.push({"id":674446,"name":"CAINFY Stainless Steel Frying Pan with Lid 11 Inch - Tri-ply Stainless Steel Healthy Skillets - Honeycomb Heavy Duty Nonstick Skillets for Gas, Electr","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Jue3eY+mL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"Nonstick Steel Pan is an essential pan for every day cooking. The large cooking surface and deep sides is good for family cooking. Features everything you need for searing, simmering, frying, boiling, and more. Frying pan stainless steel interior is Honeycomb texture for quick and even heating, extra-easy food release and cleanup. Nonstick wok is dishwasher safe and oven safe up to 400 °F. Triply stainless steel dual-honeycomb nonstick frying Pan / Wok. The Pan / Wok structure is a heavy-duty nonstick with three layers of stainless steel and an aluminium composition. 1.Interior layer food grade stainless steel 304 with an engraved Raised Honeycomb Pattern. 2.Middle core aluminium alloy for heat retentions, fast and uniform heat distribution. 3.Exterior layer stainless steel 430 is robust and ideal for the induction cooktop. Features： 1.No yellowing: slight oil fume, full coverage of inside and outside bee nets, farewell to sticky pan yellowing.If the frying pan is discolored, add a little vinegar to the discolored area and wipe it clean. 2.Comfortable Detachable Handle: The Heat-insulated handles provide a comfortable grip while you are cooking. The convenient helper handle gives added support while moving the pan. 3.Scratch resistant: Metal utensil safe,100% scratch resistant and easy to clean. Suitable for any turner, acid and alkali resistant, non-corrosive, can be used in dishwashers. 4.Honeycomb Nonstick: The principle of water vapor self-separation nonstick is adopted, and under the separation effect of the honeycomb protective layer, the contact area between the food and the pot surface is reduced, and the gas suspension effect is formed, achieve the self-separating nonstick, less fumes. Specification: -Fry Pan Diameter: 11 inches -Fry Pan Height: 2.36 inches -Stainless Steel Handle: 8.5 Inches -Total length: 19.5 Inches","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Jue3eY+mL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"CAINFY","source_asin":"B08FZZVWRW","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-674446","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08FZZVWRW","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08FZZVWRW","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
