window.products.push({"id":674470,"name":"Dishwasher Magnet Clean Dirty Sign Indicator Non Scratching Backing Magnet Beautiful Box Sticky Tab Adhesion Magnetic Option 3 Color Styles Easy to Us","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81HP11wsW9L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"NO MORE CONFUSION: Weather the dishes are clean or dirty our Round magnetic dishwasher clean dirty sign indicator is a high quality kitchen item which indicates and resolve this issue perfectly. Confusion is over now in which you have to walk over and open your dishwasher to see if the dishes have been washed yet. Elegant design will suit any type of kitchen style or office. EASY TO USE: Simply Attach our scratch resistant to the outside of your dishwasher and as you load the dishwasher with unclean dishes, keep the sign on the DIRTY RED, but as soon as you put that dishwasher tab in and turn it on immediately rotate the shutter to CLEAN GREEN before you walk away. STRONG MAGNETS: Teja’s round dishwasher magnet will never scratch your Dishwasher. Adhesive options are also available with our clean dirty sign indicator so if you have stainless steel appliances dishwasher clean dirty sign indicator will attach with them too. PERFECT SIZE: Not too small not too big which fit or suits to any size of dish washer .this good looking sign indicator is handy too. Made with high quality, water resistant materials that have a perfect finish to look great in any kitchen, office and restaurant. BEST QUALITY: Round Dishwasher Sign Indicator comes up with a good looking box. Your friends and family will love you more if you give them this pleasant high quality scratch resistant surprise gift which solve their frustration which they are facing too in their kitchen or may be in their office.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81HP11wsW9L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Teja's","source_asin":"B07FYLTL85","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-674470","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07FYLTL85","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07FYLTL85","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
