window.products.push({"id":674491,"name":"OCTROT Heated Electric Throw Blanket, Faux Fur Sherpa Heating Blanket (50” X60”), Thick Soft Plush Heat Electric Warming Lap Blanket for Adults with 5","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/812ddhpJUkL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"SAY GOODBYE TO THE COLD WINTER: Maybe the reason you bought an heating blanket throw is to make winter warmer, congratulations on finding the secret to warmth! When you have a fleece electric blanket, you will wear it when you are reading, you will put it on your lap when you are working, it will accompany you to nap and sleep, and you will cover it while watching TV on the sofa. Like an electric heat blanket that grows on your body. WE HAVE SAVINGS IN MIND FOR YOU: Do you think turning on the heating is too expensive? Because of the cold winter has to make you pay expensive heating bills. If you have a heated throw blanket, you only pay a small electricity bill, greatly reducing your winter expenses. Octrot electric blanket is as soft as rabbit fur, and every touch is as smooth as you can imagine. The fleece material on the back makes you feel doubled warm, even after the power is cut off DISTINCTIVE MULTI-FUNCTION CONTROLLER: If the heart of the electric blanket sherpa is the controller, then the heart of our heated throw is more flexible than those on the market. You can flexibly choose the automatic shutdown function of five time periods of 1h, 2h, 4h, 6h, and 8h according to your needs. The microplush heated blanket automatically shuts down regularly to ensure safety and energy saving. The electric blanket has 10 temperature settings that can be controlled from 59°F-131°F, and in just 5 minutes, you can enjoy a temperature of 131°F. QUALITY AND SERVICE ARE GUARANTEED: if you are still hesitating about the service life, you can buy our washable heated blanket with confidence.Our electric blanket throw has been upgraded and repeatedly tested, the technology has become mature, the heat is uniform, the use time is long, and the product is safe and reliable. After you purchase the electric blanket with timer, we will also provide after-sales service guarantee to meet your best consumption experience. CAN BE USED WITH WASHING MACHINE: You don't need to worry about the heater blanket being difficult to clean after it gets stains, our soft electric blanket solves your worries. You simply remove the power cord at the connector and throw it in the washing machine for cleaning. As good as a new blanket when you take it out of the washing machine. But be careful not to connect the power supply when the heated blankey is not completely dry.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/812ddhpJUkL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"OCTROT","source_asin":"B0B83QB132","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-674491","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B83QB132","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B83QB132","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
