window.products.push({"id":674514,"name":"Me Time Joy 17 \" Black Magnetic Poster Hanger Frame - Wooden Hanging Frame with Strong Magnet for Scratch Off Poster, Art, Scroll, Print, Picture - Wo","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71-zu3nLZYS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The Perfect Solution for Scratch off Posters and Maps! Premium Natural Wood : The natural grain of the log is visible making it one in a million. The magnetic frame hanger is strong, durable and moisture-resistant and rot-resistant. Powerful Embedded Magnets :  Industrial grade N52 magnets can hold up posters and artwork for long time periods. With three magnets on each stick and 12 magnets in total, these magnetic hanging frames can easily hang tapestry, prints, posters and any kind of artwork as long as it is not too thick. Ease of use : Assemble the magnetic wood frames in minutes and change the decor of any room daily! Versatile : This reusable poster frames can be used to hang poster, prints, scrolls, artwork or tapestry. It can hang any artwork smaller than 17” too. Since the magnets are embedded, the artwork remains in pristine condition. The poster/prints/tapestry can be changed daily on this hanging poster frame without any worry. Convenient Storage : Since it can be used a wall scroll hanger, it can be easily rolled up and put away neatly with the scroll still attached to the frames. Size: Any poster that is 17” inch wide or smaller can be used to hang with these hangers. Package includes: 4 wooden sticks with N52 magnets 1 leather rope POSTER NOT INCLUDED Our Promise: We are so confident of our quality of our premium hanging poster frame that we offer a manufacturer guarantee; If you are unhappy in any way, we will replace the frames! Go ahead and ADD TO CART!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71-zu3nLZYS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Me Time Joy","source_asin":"B08YWJP129","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-674514","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08YWJP129","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08YWJP129","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":674515,"name":"Caroline's Treasures BB2142CARC American Flag and Longhair Creme Dachshund Set of 2 Cup Holder Car Coasters, Absorbent Sandstone Coasters for Car Cup ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":13.79,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71r7gYVnioL._AC_SL1042_.jpg","description":"Colorful absorbant Sandstone car Coasters. Set of 2 with this design. Both Coasters measure 2 1/2 inches in diameter and are a little over 1/4 inch high. A cut out is included in the coaster to make it easy to remove from the cup holder in the vehicle. Make a statement in your vehicle about your personality and keep the water from making a big mess when your drink starts to melt. Make sure to take your drink with you when you leave your vehicle and leave your coaster!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71r7gYVnioL._AC_SL1042_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Caroline's Treasures","source_asin":"B01MDRKADA","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-674515","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01MDRKADA","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01MDRKADA","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
