window.products.push({"id":674527,"name":"Banneton Proofing Basket, Banetton Bread Proofing Basket 9 Inch Round Barley Talk for Professional & Home Bakers -100% Natural Rattan Dough Scraper Li","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Nc3Q6d1rL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"We are BarleyTalk - A Brand that Focusing on High Quality Baking Utensils All the Time. ❤️Here at BarleyTalk, the quality of our products and the satisfaction of our clients are the two greatest passions of our brand, therefore we do our best to bring you top quality items at competitive prices. OBVIOUSLY DIFFERENT FROM CHEAP PRODUCTS 🌟🌟🌟🌟🌟1. 100% Natural Rattan & 100% Polished by hand2. When each basket is made, it will be specially polished by hand, so guarantee no odors, smooth surface without debris.3. Each product delicate package. EASY TO USE & CLEAN 1. After sprinkling a little more flour in the basket, put the dough into it, and see the dough ferment and expand until it double in size.2. Gently put the fermented dough to the baking tray, and then put it into the oven for baking.3. Use a brush or a cloth to clean up the basket. You can also clean it with water but the basket must be kept dry after cleaning. BAKING SUPPLIES SET INCLUDE 1. Banneton Proofing Basket (9\" Inch - Can Holds 1.5 pounds dough)2. high-quality dough scraper (To easily cut dough)    3. Washable thick linen cloth (To provide lesser sticking)4. Delicate and convenient cleaning brush ( To Easier cleaning and maintenance of baskets)5. Guidelines for the use of proofing baskets ( To faster production of better bread) Attention 1. Do not use detergent to clean the basket.2. Do not soak the basket in water for a long time, which will cause deformation.3. Don’t put the basket in the oven and avoid fire or high temperature for it is made of natural rattan.4. Keep the basket dry after cleaning.5. Since the basket is handmade, the size may vary slightly. Bonus: To become a baker that everyone likes","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Nc3Q6d1rL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Baniful","source_asin":"B088HHHYX8","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-674527","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B088HHHYX8","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B088HHHYX8","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
