window.products.push({"id":674543,"name":"Twin Mattress 8 Inch - Memory Foam Mattress 5-Layer Comfort Supportive Medium Firm Mattress in a Box with Breathable Cover, Made in USA, CertiPUR-US C","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":144.09,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71XB0x5NNSL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Say Goodbye to Sweaty Nights - Our memory foam mattress is made with a soft, breathable cover and perforated green tea gel memory foam layer that effectively ensures fresh, comfortable sleeping conditions all night long. Safe & Comfortable Sleeping Environment - The mattress is made of CertiPUR-US certified foam, which is free of any harmful emissions and substances such as formaldehyde, mercury and other heavy metals. The mattress cover is made of skin-friendly fabric that is soft to the touch. The memory foam mattress provides a healthier, cloud-like experience for your everyday sleeping. Design for All Sleeping Types - Finding the right mattress for all sleeping positions can be a challenge, but it is possible with our mattress. It comes with gel-infused memory foam and a medium-firm flex support system that provides excellent support for every sleep position, from the abdomen to the sides to the back, keeping the body and spine aligned. Mattress in a Box - The memory foam mattress is compressed, rolled up and conveniently delivered to your door in a small box for easy installation. For a better sleeping experience, please wait at least 2 hours for the mattress to fully unroll. 10-Year Limited Warranty - You can enjoy your comfortable sleep with our mattress, any unsatisfied problems, please contact our professional customer support team - nights, weekends, and holidays are also available. We are committed to making mattresses that make you happy!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71XB0x5NNSL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"VANCIKI","source_asin":"B0BFLB1ZXP","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-674543","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BFLB1ZXP","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BFLB1ZXP","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":674544,"name":"Whisky Stones CRAFT – Original Handcrafted Natural Soapstone Beverage Chilling Cubes (Set of 6) By Teroforma","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/818mGlHlkFL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"THE ORIGINAL WHISKY STONES - Teroforma saw the need to fix the issue of melted ice ruining your favorite pour of liquor. To address this, they crafted the first whiskey stones out of soapstone, so you could truly enjoy your whiskey or scotch \"on the rocks\". NO DILUTION - If you enjoy your favorite alcohol gently chilled, then you know what it's like to have it get ruined by ice dilution. Worry no more! Whisky chilling rocks are designed to cool your favorite bourbon, scotch, or whiskey in 5 minutes without having to worry about losing natural flavors. US MADE SOAPSTONE - Using a closed-loop sustainable milling process, Teroforma has proudly kept their manufacturing right at home, in the USA. Each whisky stone is handcrafted in the oldest soapstone mill in America from the finest soapstone materials around. REUSABLE ICE CUBES - Ice is great for the first use, after that it just melts away. With whiskey beverage cubes you don't have to worry about your investment going away. Simply wash when not in use and air dry before placing in the freezer for 4 hours before placing in your next dram. WHISKY GIFT SET - Turn any whiskey lover's birthday, Father's Day, or Christmas that much better with a sophisticated bar tool. Each set comes beautifully packaged while including a handy muslin storage bag for easy storage.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/818mGlHlkFL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"TEROFORMA","source_asin":"B017WUQIZQ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-674544","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B017WUQIZQ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B017WUQIZQ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
