window.products.push({"id":674625,"name":"EVEREST GLOBAL Glass Jewelry Jar Cube Facets Candy Storage Bowl with Lid Sugar Cans Kitchen Bath","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":21.98,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61VL6--CrpS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The surface is embossed with block pattern. The top of the lid is a small golden tower. The golden coating embellishes the entire jewelry box, making it more beautiful and eye-catching. Gifts for woman -- Every woman lacks an exquisite candy glass jar with lid. This small glass jewelry box can not only store earrings/rings/pearl necklaces, but also can be used as a fragrance box and storage candy jar to store candies, dried fruits, etc.Also decorate as candy dish for office desk Its bottom is very stable and it is not easy to fall and its lid is easy to remove, suitable for bath use. please note, the lid does not have a rubber seal, so it is not airtight. Even though it's lovely small, but the size is not a CON, otherwise this tiny jewelry jar fits anywhere. It can be send as an adorable gift. Packaging was good. Food safe. Hand wash only.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61VL6--CrpS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"EVEREST GLOBAL","source_asin":"B08Q81NHN6","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-674625","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08Q81NHN6","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08Q81NHN6","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":674626,"name":"Kotobukiya One Piece New World Version: Zoro and Sanji Silicone Ice Tray","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61DlHzvatBL._AC_SL1050_.jpg","description":"From the Manufacturer A Kotobukiya Japanese import. After the amazing success of Kotobukiya's silicone ice trays capturing iconic images from Star Wars, DC Comics, and Neon Genesis Evangelion, things are getting a little sillier with all new trays from the anime series One Piece. The Straw Hat pirates are in full force with LUFFY, CHOPPER, ZORO and SANJI, USOPP FRANKY and BROOK, AND NAMI and ROBIN WITH SANJI NEW WORLD VER. Whether you're making a treat for your family or spicing up a One Piece themed event, these sturdy trays lets you capture ice, chocolate, jelly, or cupcakes in the fun shapes of all of your favorite One Piece characters. Durable, heat and cold resistant, and oven and microwave safe, the pirate trays are great for baking or freezing. Each tray has molds of the fun characters in iconic poses and with their trademark items. Collect all five new ice trays (sold separately) for the ultimate One Piece party.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61DlHzvatBL._AC_SL1050_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Kotobukiya","source_asin":"B009RHP21E","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-674626","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B009RHP21E","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B009RHP21E","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":674627,"name":"National Artcraft® Make-A-Candle-from-Anything with Glass Oil Lamp Inserts (5 Pkg/3)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":49.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31vR7ikL28L._AC_.jpg","description":"National Artcraft's glass lamp oil Insert is ideal for creating decorative oil lamps from almost any material. The lamp oil is held inside the glass tube so there is no worry about leakage. Simply create a space 3/4\" in diameter by 3-1/4\" in depth, drop the insert in place and add the lamp oil. It's that simple and your oil lamp is ready to light. These inserts measure 4-3/4\" long overall. The tube diameter is 5/8\" with a 1\" diameter flange 7/8\" from the top. The glass wick holder removes for easy filling. Long lasting braided cotton wicks are included with each insert. When completely filled the insert will burn for approximately 1-1/2 hours using a low flame. These are packaged 3 inserts to a box.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31vR7ikL28L._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"National Artcraft","source_asin":"B07PP9GBTR","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-674627","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07PP9GBTR","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07PP9GBTR","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":674628,"name":"EUHOMY 4-in-1 Electric Wine Opener Gift Box with Foil Cutter, Cordless Electric Wine Bottle Opener Battery Powered, Salt Pepper Grinder, Handheld Milk","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":20.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/812qFqxxM7L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【ALL-IN-ONE SET】This kitchen tool set provides a one-stop solution for corkscrew, grinding and foaming. Gift set includes: 1 milk frother, 2 gravity Electric grinders, 1 electric wine bottle opener and 1 foil cutter. It is a lightweight, portable, practical and sophisticated holiday gift. The well-designed black and gold exclusive gift box is the best choice for birthday parties, anniversaries, housewarming, Thanksgiving, Christmas, Hanukkah and other parties, or for your gifts and personal use. 【ELECTRIC WINE BOTTLE OPENER】 Euhomy electric bottle opener removes the cork in 5 seconds without breaking it. Up to 100 wine bottles can be opened at one time. Powered by 4 AAA batteries (batteries not included), the cordless electric wine opener is small and portable.The wine opener features With ABS matte black and glossy stainless steel, the matte feel is very comfortable. In addition, the gift box also comes with a foil cutter to help you easily remove the aluminum foil. 【GRAVITY ELECTRIC GRINDER】Euhomy electric pepper grinder can not only grind upside down, but also has a safety switch, which can effectively prevent accidental touch. Each electric grinder requires 4AA batteries (not included). You can also easily adjust the pepper grinder knob to choose the coarseness of spice,salt or pepper. The pepper grinder set is equipped with large capacity grinding chamber, and is designed with a transparent and visible acrylic lid for easy identification of seasoning. 【MILK FROTHER】Euhomy one-touch milk whisk creates creamy foam in just 15-30 seconds. Our portable handheld milk frother is made of 304 durable stainless steel, just put the electric whisk in running hot water and turn on briefly - Clean now! ;The milk stirrer is powered by 2 AA batteries (not included), wireless and portable; the stainless steel whisk is equipped with a powerful motor, which makes very little noise when running, its The compact motorized design fits easily into a drawer. 【Quality Assurance】The products in the Euhomy Kitchen Tools Gift Box are certified by FCC, CE, RoHS and are durable for a long time. Euhomy has always provided its guests with excellent service and provides a 1-year quality guarantee. If you have any questions about the products in our kitchen tool gift box set, please contact our customer service team.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/812qFqxxM7L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"EUHOMY","source_asin":"B0B5TZ1XFW","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-674628","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B5TZ1XFW","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B5TZ1XFW","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
