window.products.push({"id":674691,"name":"YHomU 4PCS Artificial Sunflower Garlands, 7.4ft Silk Sunflower Vine Garlands, Faux Flower Vines with Leaves, Fake Plant Decorations for Wedding, Birth","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":14.97,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/816cTYIJHRL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Lifelike Artificial Sunflower Garlands】Every sunflower on the garland comes in a complete structure including petals, flower disk, and calyx, with a 2-layer petal design that well increases the flower texture. The leaves have clear veins, and the serrated edges make them more vivid. All details come to life just like a real flower garland. 【Vibrant Flower Decorations】With a length of 7.4ft, each flower vine garland is dotted with 10 sunflowers measuring 4 inches in diameter and 69 leaves, where the full, dense design presents a better decoration effect. Besides, the bright yellow and green colors add a hit to the space, bringing vigorous vitality. 【4 Flower Garlands for DIY】The flexible plastic vine can be bent and shaped freely as you like, and the flowers are detachable from the vine, thanks to which you can add or remove the sunflowers, or replace them with other flowers of different varieties. The package includes 4 garlands for you to combine at will, providing more DIY possibilities. 【Easy-care Year-round Ornaments】Unlike real flowers, our artificial sunflower garlands do not require watering, pruning, and other care, greatly saving your time and energy. They will never wither, without seasonal restrictions, which serve all year round. The exquisite craftsmanship ensures the durability and long-lasting colors of the garlands, so you don't have to worry about their short service life. 【Wide Application】These beautiful sunflower garlands can be used to surround railings, tables, walls, arches, swings, etc., adding a strong natural atmosphere for daily home decoration. They are also suitable for weddings, birthday parties, baby showers, bridal showers, and more occasions.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/816cTYIJHRL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"YHomU","source_asin":"B0BPMD3HQN","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-674691","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BPMD3HQN","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BPMD3HQN","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
