window.products.push({"id":674728,"name":"12 Pack Tall Metallic Taper Candles - 10 Inch Gold Painted Metallic, Dripless, Unscented Dinner Candle - Paraffin Wax with Cotton Wicks - Individually","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":24.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81Qi3Irs5uL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"PREMIUM QUALITY CANDLES Need some natural candlelight to illuminate your surroundings for a special occasion? Look no further than these tall taper candles by Hyoola. They exude a warm glow and a long-lasting flame. Our tapered design is narrower on top and wider towards the base for candles with an elegant look that fit in most standard-sized candle holders. Made of 100% high-quality paraffin wax, our candles are over-dipped, or dipped in layers, for a beautiful smooth finish. Our 100% cotton wick ensures a long-lasting, even burn. Available in three sizes for up to 8, 10, and 12 hours of use. PRODUCT FEATURES: 100% Paraffin Wax Candles 100% Cotton Wicks Individually Wrapped Over Dipped for Smooth Finish Dripless Unscented Made in Europe Perfect for Restaurants or catered events. 3 Sizes: - 10” - 8 Burn Time- 12” - 10 Hour Burn Time- 14” - 12 Hour Burn Time Available Colors: Gold-Painted, Silver-Painted, Copper-Painted MULTIPURPOSE USE Hyoola’s 12-piece candle boxes equip you for any occasion, whether it be a wedding or celebration, religious observance, and more. Illuminate the aisle which the bride and groom walk down to their wedding canopy with a natural, powerful brightness. Place a candle on each restaurant table to create a pleasant ambiance that will make customers wish to return. The clean color of these candles, in combination with their elegant tapered shape, makes them perfect for church prayers, Sabbath kindling lights, and other religious rituals as well. Why Are My Taper Candles Dripping? The candle might not be completely vertical. If your candle isn't sitting straight, it will burn unevenly, which can lead to wax running too far down the candle before it hardens.  There could be a draft, air conditioning, fans, outdoors, window draft as well, as a slight breeze which can also cause the candle to burn unevenly and lead to excess wax.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81Qi3Irs5uL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Hyoola","source_asin":"B076MFC8DP","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-674728","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B076MFC8DP","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B076MFC8DP","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
