window.products.push({"id":674739,"name":"Bev Doolittle TWO INDIAN HORSES Matted & Framed Art Print Open Edition","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81pAGYWd6rL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"“Two Indian Horses” by Bev Doolittle This is an open edition art print. The image size is 19 3/4\" x 3 1/4\" The matted and framed size is 27\" x 10 1/2\" The top mat is off white and the bottom mat is rust. The frame is 1 3/4\" wide. This print is NEWLY Matted & Framed in our own custom frame shop for sale on Amazon. It is NOT used. THERE IS A DIFFERENCE IN MATTING AND FRAMING Do you what type of materials were used in framing other art you might be interested in that you find online? We do because all of our art is professionally matted and framed using acid-free, museum quality archival materials in our own custom framing shop. Many times others DO NOT know the materials used in their art, they just simply copy and paste text that sounds good into their listing. We only use that mats are 100% cotton rag that meets the Library of Congress standard for conservation. The mats are covered with UV light blocking plexi glass to protect the art from damaging uv light rays. The backing where the artwork will rest is 100% acid free foam core. The back of the frame is protected and sealed with a dust cover. The braided picture wire is covered with vinyl and secured into the back of the frame. This print is ready to hang on your wall and comes complete with a recommended hanger. We buy our art from licensed publishers and art dealers. All of the art we sell is guaranteed authentic.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81pAGYWd6rL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Bev Doolittle","source_asin":"B0826J87BV","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-674739","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0826J87BV","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0826J87BV","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
