window.products.push({"id":674782,"name":"Flex Hand Dryer - Dries Hands in Less Than 10s. 10 Year Warranty. Heavy Duty Metal Casted Enclosure. Consumes only 800W. Modular Design facilitates Ma","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":499.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71opoArAhYL._SL1500_.jpg","description":"Flex is one of the most energy-efficient hand dryers on the market. It's sleek and attractive design will give your facility an elegant look. At the same time, its simple design provides easy installation and maintenance, while its small footprint provides an efficient use of wall space. Flex can be surface mounted or recessed in the wall cavity without any other accessories. Most of all, we stand behind our product. Flex Features: Touchless: IR activated High pressure High volume air flow Small foot print ADA compliant (When 1.90 cm (.75 in.) installed in the wall) Tamper proof All metal durable enclosure Energy efficient: <6 amps Flexible mounting options The top cover is also 3 mm (.11 in) thick on average and designed like an egg shell with reinforced ribs. The module can be removed and replaced by an upgraded version in less than 2 minutes.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71opoArAhYL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Flex Hand Dryer","source_asin":"B07579KT1L","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-674782","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07579KT1L","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07579KT1L","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
