window.products.push({"id":674904,"name":"16 Slot Ice Cube Tray - Easy Release White Ice Mold with Stackable Design for 1 x 1.25 Inch Cubes by Back of House Ltd. (2-Pack)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71aS46VHN7L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The First Step to Making Something Great Chunks of frozen water is the foundation of all the best cold drinks, slushies, cocktails, and smoothies. When you feel like making something delicious, struggling with step one can ruin the whole experience. Ice trays may be simple, but they sure make things complicated sometimes: if it's not spilling all over the place on the way to the freezer, it's nearly breaking a nail when you try pry out an ice cube. Sounds dramatic, but once you try a flexible plastic tray that has the best features of both plastic and silicone trays, you'll never go back! Why You'll Love It Back of House, Ltd's ice cube trays look like your everyday ice tray. That's because they are, but with all the right qualities for the best ice-making experience. Made from a durable yet flexible plastic, these molds won't flop over and spill the water on the way to the fridge, and they won't crack or break when removing the ice. Once the ice is frozen, simply twist the tray to each side and see how they easily each cube comes out of the mold. Each of the 16 slots creates a 1\" x 1.25\" ice cube that's great for standard drinks, mixed drinks, and even making smoothies. The plastic materials nonstick texture is dishwasher safe and easy to clean by hand.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71aS46VHN7L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Back of House Ltd.","source_asin":"B07B4LHDTB","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-674904","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07B4LHDTB","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07B4LHDTB","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
