window.products.push({"id":674978,"name":"Woman Firefighter Ornaments 2022 – Polyresin Firefighter Christmas Ornament – Personalized Firefighter Gifts for Women – Unique Firefighter Christmas ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":17.94,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71RoLZ5EjFL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Premium Quality Polyresin Firefighter Ornament – Unlike other Holiday décor that breaks and falls apart in a matter of weeks. Our Firemen Christmas ornament is durable and lightweight for lasting quality and easy hanging on the family tree for a special twinkle in your ornament tree décor! Vibrant colors and festive details of a firefighter. This Christmas, honor and remember all firefighters who risk their lives to serve and protect the community with this special fire ornament! Expert Artist Personalization – Other personalized firefighter ornaments for Christmas tree often arrive with messy, clumsy personalization (or worse, the wrong name). Our talented in-house artists handwrite each personalization to your exact specifications using custom paint pens imported from Germany. Every fireman ornament is delicately hand painted to ensure its unique appearance for a ONE-OF-A-KIND firefighter Christmas ornament you’ll always cherish. Perfect Gifts for Firefighters – Made especially for the new, active and retired firefighters who protect the people with so much courage. These firefighter ornaments serve as a tribute to their unwavering dedication to country and family. Crafted with festive details and vibrant colors and personalized to your specifications, your firefighter decor will make your Christmas tree feel extra special and unique to your home. The ultimate present for all the firefighters in your life! 24-Hour Order Processing – Our fireman decorations make beautiful firefighting gifts, fire chief gifts for women, fire academy graduation gift, retired firewoman gifts and firefighter decorations. Your firefighter Christmas ornaments will arrive ready for gifting, nestled in tissue paper with a Gift Box, Gift Bag and Gift Tag – no need for wrapping! The perfect fire department gifts to show off your fire department pride and firefighter gifts for any fan of the brave women fighting fires! Happy Firefighters – At Holiday Traditions, we’re dedicated to crafting beautiful firefighter decorations and firefighter Christmas gifts for families to celebrate the holidays – and their love for each other. Having been in business for over 17 years, creating and personalizing over 640,000 tree ornaments along the way, we’re experts in quality craftsmanship. If for any reason you don’t love your firefighter decorations 2022, please reach out to us directly so we can make it right.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71RoLZ5EjFL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Holiday Traditions","source_asin":"B09N3VNWMG","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-674978","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09N3VNWMG","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09N3VNWMG","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
